{"id":"927f4ead14ec3c2d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-effective-finite-cover.md","title":"有效闭子空间开覆盖的有限子覆盖可搜索","display":"thm-effective-finite-cover — 有效闭子空间开覆盖的有限子覆盖可搜索","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-effective-finite-cover","aliases":["20-thm-effective-finite-cover"],"display":"thm-effective-finite-cover — 有效闭子空间开覆盖的有限子覆盖可搜索","chapter":"8","section":"8.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 8.5.1(v)；相对闭子空间的本地推广","source_printed_pages":[169,170],"source_pdf_pages":[202,203],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","[[20-thm-konig]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-effective-finite-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-effective-finite-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-finite-cover — 有效闭子空间开覆盖的有限子覆盖可搜索"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 8.5.1(v)；相对闭子空间的本地推广"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span><span>170</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>202</span><span>203</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 c.e. 串集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 为递增有限阶段枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\">\\([T]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-finite-cover}\\vdash\n\\exists s,n\\ \\forall\\tau\\in T\\cap2^n\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_s\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-finite-cover}\\vdash\n\\exists s,n\\ \\forall\\tau\\in T\\cap2^n\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_s\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>存在统一部分可计算的转换器，在上述覆盖承诺成立时停止，返回这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,n)\">\\((s,n)\\)</span> 和有限覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 的完整代码。</p>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 时，某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 覆盖全空间恰当且仅当长度\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_s=\\max(\\{|\\rho|:\\rho\\in S_s\\}\\cup\\{0\\})\">\\(n_s=\\max(\\{|\\rho|:\\rho\\in S_s\\}\\cup\\{0\\})\\)</span> 的每串都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 前缀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>紧致性给有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq S\">\\(F\\subseteq S\\)</span> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\">\\([T]\\)</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq S_s\">\\(F\\subseteq S_s\\)</span>。树中避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 前缀的节点组成无路径的二进制树，König 引理使其某层为空，给所需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,n)\">\\((s,n)\\)</span> 并作有限检验即可搜索证书。证书确实覆盖每条路径，因为每条路径有长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的树前缀。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]=\\varnothing\">\\([T]=\\varnothing\\)</span>，有限空层本身为证书，可输出空覆盖。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s=\\varnothing\">\\(S_s=\\varnothing\\)</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 满，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_s=0\">\\(n_s=0\\)</span> 的空串无覆盖前缀，算法不会误判。转换器仅对覆盖承诺保证停止；一般输入的覆盖性无需在此被判定。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 169–170 / PDF 202–203。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-konig]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"[T]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-finite-cover}\\vdash\n\\exists s,n\\ \\forall\\tau\\in T\\cap2^n\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_s\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"(s,n)","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"T=2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"n_s=\\max(\\{|\\rho|:\\rho\\in S_s\\}\\cup\\{0\\})","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"[T]","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq S_s","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"(s,n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"[T]=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"S_s=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"n_s=0","display":false}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"364ab8ad1d9d7918","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-effective-finite-cover]]。"}],"outgoing":["b73290a0af01d44f","59004ac6d23e86